"blocks":null,"service_name":"AtCoder","service_icon":"http://img.atcoder.jp/assets/atcoder.png","thumb_width":280,"thumb_height":280,"from_url":"https://atcoder.jp/posts/20","original_url":"https://atcoder.jp/posts/20"}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sasu","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qErZr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a969be48-f551-47fa-a0a4-ff050160ec95","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"私も全然なれてないので DP 実装するときよく範囲外アクセスとかやっちゃうんですよねー","ts":"1633789335.172600","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1633789391.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aslw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"299b5e23-4271-470e-af6f-b77b50c56609","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"競プロ、高校のときに勉強したときの知識で止まってるのでちゃんと勉強しないと楽しくなさそう。","ts":"1633789222.171000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OcG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"53e90e70-7c4b-4946-8bc1-70620c934e24","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"~とりあえず内包表記の中で再帰呼び出しをするというのは計算量ヤバそう~\n私が単にコード理解してないだけだった、すいません。if の分岐でキャッシュ取ってるんですね","ts":"1633789128.170700","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1633789185.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9iRk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73328829-4136-496f-861d-67c193719649","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://sarashina-nikki65.hatenablog.com/entry/2018/10/11/163203\u003e\nメモ化再帰ですね。DP理解できずにそのままにしてます...","ts":"1633789126.170500","attachments":[{"fallback":"文学徒が競プロをするブログ: メモ化再帰ちょっと理解した - 文学徒が競プロをするブログ","id":1,"title":"メモ化再帰ちょっと理解した - 文学徒が競プロをするブログ","title_link":"https://sarashina-nikki65.hatenablog.com/entry/2018/10/11/163203","text":"概要 メモ化再帰をほんの少し理解したので書く。 ただしこれはプログラマ文脈で言うところの「チョットデキル」的な意味合いではなく、むしろ「完全に理解した」的なニュアンスであることに注意されたし。 なお、これは再帰関数が難しいと感じられる人にも分かりやすいように工夫して書いたので、再帰関数を理解したい人にも読んでいただきたい。 フィボナッチ数列でヤる フィボナッチ数列は漸化式が F(N) = F(N-1) + F (N-2) となる数列です。 私の雑な理解としては、漸化式を書ける問題は大体再帰で解けます。そして再帰で書くと無駄な計算をしてしまうことが多いので、メモ化して高速化することが必要となるの…","image_url":"https://cdn-ak.f.st-hatena.com/images/fotolife/s/sarashina-nikki65/20181011/20181011145150.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1539243123,"service_name":"文学徒が競プロをするブログ","service_icon":"https://sarashina-nikki65.hatenablog.com/icon/touch","from_url":"https://sarashina-nikki65.hatenablog.com/entry/2018/10/11/163203","original_url":"https://sarashina-nikki65.hatenablog.com/entry/2018/10/11/163203"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BH4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a32a2fac-4dff-49be-b48e-79c9d18d418d","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"関係がDAGであると証明してメモ化再帰はよくあります","ts":"1633789105.170100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3fq0N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1010f9cb-b1c4-40ea-af26-fe8e36740c89","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"メモ化をしていると思いきや再帰を使っている…？","ts":"1633789026.169000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FUJc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"194e319a-dd9b-42f6-9b4f-67730f3ff4b4","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ですね ( \u003chttps://atcoder.jp/contests/abc222/editorial/2747\u003e )\n```よって、まずは多項式時間で答えを求めるアルゴリズムを得ることができました。上記の遷移からなる DP の計算量を考えると、\n\n更新する必要がある要素の個数：O(NM)\n要素を1 個計算にかかる計算量：O(M)になるので計算量は\nO(NM2) とわかります。しかしこれでは TLE してしまうので、どうにかして DP の計算量を落としたいです。```","ts":"1633788934.168400","attachments":[{"fallback":"AtCoder: Editorial - Exawizards Programming Contest 2021（AtCoder Beginner Contest 222）","id":1,"title":"Editorial - Exawizards Programming Contest 2021（AtCoder Beginner Contest 222）","title_link":"https://atcoder.jp/contests/abc222/editorial/2747","text":"AtCoder is a programming contest site for anyone from beginners to experts. We hold weekly programming contests online.","thumb_url":"https://img.atcoder.jp/assets/atcoder.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"AtCoder","service_icon":"http://img.atcoder.jp/assets/atcoder.png","thumb_width":280,"thumb_height":280,"from_url":"https://atcoder.jp/contests/abc222/editorial/2747","original_url":"https://atcoder.jp/contests/abc222/editorial/2747"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ePD6u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d793d58-d751-4684-b413-fa95121e7431","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"デフォルトだと1000らしいので、これにひっかかってそう。\n\u003chttps://note.nkmk.me/python-sys-recursionlimit/\u003e","ts":"1633788873.167700","attachments":[{"fallback":"Pythonの再帰回数の上限を確認・変更（sys.setrecursionlimitなど） | note.nkmk.me","id":1,"title":"Pythonの再帰回数の上限を確認・変更（sys.setrecursionlimitなど） | note.nkmk.me","title_link":"https://note.nkmk.me/python-sys-recursionlimit/","text":"Pythonでは再帰回数の上限（最大再帰数）が設定されている。呼び出し回数の多い再帰関数を実行するには上限を変更する必要がある。標準ライブラリのsysモジュールの関数を使う。再帰回数はスタックサイズによっても制限される。環境によっては標準ライブラリのresourceモジュールで最大スタックサイズを変更できる（Ubuntu...","image_url":"https://i.gyazo.com/e77bf6a79f88b77ef766ed998cff3d89.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"note.nkmk.me","from_url":"https://note.nkmk.me/python-sys-recursionlimit/","original_url":"https://note.nkmk.me/python-sys-recursionlimit/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Sk8h3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"723fd73c-bcfb-4d57-ba2d-13f99d852805","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"たぶんそう、そしてどっちにしろTLEなきがする","ts":"1633788872.167500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9CsX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06b1d0fe-3112-4b11-8daf-f633a5fd27d3","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あー。実行時エラー、再帰上限か。。？","ts":"1633788804.167100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UE1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"837573f9-8243-43b6-895f-bd6ccf91c299","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"コンテスト中は隠す理由もまぁ分かるんですが、コンテスト終わったら。。。(ry","ts":"1633788514.166800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NUIJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4535a18d-8c69-4db6-a3ab-ce158beb2265","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"日本語変になった！","ts":"1633788507.166600","edited":{"user":"US5UW1UNB","ts":"1633788532.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XTl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a79ceb8-69a0-41e4-939c-65b2fed387ba","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"自分で作る能力作れって言ってました！","ts":"1633788497.166400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9kA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f85eb150-d43c-486a-a70b-b3833fe5d1b5","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"どういう入力で失敗したのか普通に知りたいと思うんだけど、なんで見せてくれないのか","ts":"1633788469.166100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QAhS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05b41e49-3f41-4e17-9618-8e516d1fa3c5","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"(というかジャッジサーバーだけのテストケース、コンテスト終わったら公開して欲しい)","ts":"1633788439.165600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JR+9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ddd49c85-c1d6-4235-ba7a-0ec533d0c636","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あーなるほど。読めそう","ts":"1633788399.165400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MJ7k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b7d99ac-c204-46dc-96c5-5aca05176ca6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"実行時エラーで問題(テストケース)を読むアホが昔いたんすよ…","ts":"1633788372.165100","edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1633788385.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LCGJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f563ba82-bc57-4c46-ad82-639b96c48078","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"AtCoder、実行時エラー出たならエラーメッセージを教えて欲しい。","ts":"1633788335.164800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VtW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e78bf03f-e6ac-490d-b244-0f0c603dcaa4","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://atcoder.jp/contests/abc222/submissions/26467745\u003e\n実行時エラー。。？はて。。\n```MOD = 998244353\n\nn = int(input())\na = [0] + list(map(int, input().split()))\nb = [0] + list(map(int, input().split()))\n\nmemo = [[0 for _ in range(3010)] for _ in range(3010)]\n\ndef solve(i, j):\n    if memo[i][j]:\n        return memo[i][j]\n    elif i \u0026lt;= n-1:\n        memo[i][j] = sum([solve(i+1, elm) for elm in range(max(j, a[i+1]), b[i+1]+1)]) % MOD\n        return memo[i][j]\n    else:\n        return 1\n\n\nprint(sum([solve(1, elm) for elm in range(a[1], b[1]+1)]) % MOD)```","ts":"1633787938.164500","attachments":[{"fallback":"AtCoder: Submission #26467745 - Exawizards Programming Contest 2021（AtCoder Beginner Contest 222）","id":1,"title":"Submission #26467745 - Exawizards Programming Contest 2021（AtCoder Beginner Contest 222）","title_link":"https://atcoder.jp/contests/abc222/submissions/26467745","text":"AtCoder is a programming contest site for anyone from beginners to experts. We hold weekly programming contests online.","thumb_url":"https://img.atcoder.jp/assets/atcoder.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"AtCoder","service_icon":"http://img.atcoder.jp/assets/atcoder.png","thumb_width":280,"thumb_height":280,"from_url":"https://atcoder.jp/contests/abc222/submissions/26467745","original_url":"https://atcoder.jp/contests/abc222/submissions/26467745"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BH/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"138ecc42-200e-42fe-9cbb-af378c557acf","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"知りませんでした! ありがとうございますー!","ts":"1633790023.177200","thread_ts":"1633789775.173500","parent_user_id":"UGBFLFH2T","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B1Z"}]}]
